{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21936","headline":"哭刘敦质 · 白居易","name":"哭刘敦质","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小树两株柏，新土三尺坟。\n苍苍白露草，此地哭刘君。\n哭君岂无辞，辞云君子人。\n如何天不吊，穷悴至终身。\n愚者多贵寿，贤者独贱迍。\n龙亢彼无悔，蠖屈此不伸。\n哭罢持此辞，吾将诘羲文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}